  "design": {
    "idea": "ACT IV \u2014 THE SNUFFED WICK (ASTONISHING ROOM): Hollow Wick steals BOTH Bolt and Beam! Completely gunless, angle two Blue Transformers atop a revolving stage turntable, pull brass winch rings to swing them into Hollow Wick's own stolen beams (latching Blue sensors S1 & S2), push Rose Glass into beam E2 and rotate clear to latch S3, draw drifting golden spotlight Ember-Motes, and shatter the Obsidian Seal with Sunflare!",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ketsu",
    "teaches": "Zero-gun optical mastery: rotating turntable mirrors + Pull-Ring winches + Rose Glass tinting + Spotlight Ember-Motes fueling Sunflare.",
    "decisions": 11,
    "expert_s": 65,
    "reward": "open_theatre_r10",
    "why": "Signature astonishing Act IV puzzle room where losing both shooting buttons turns the revolving stage itself into your optical weapon.",
